HST Office: groups folded before a wide group come back when they fit.

Groups fold in the tab's fold order, by default from the right. When a wide group has to fold, the
groups folded before it can fit again. On Writer's Extension tab, at 1920 px, Controls (about 950 px
even at its smallest) folded, and Protect and Templates, which had folded before it, stayed in the
chevron popup with 550 px free. After the fold the ladder gives back every folded group that fits
beside the others at its smallest, the most important first, and Resize folds exactly the groups the
ladder chose for that width.

- vcl/inc/PriorityMergedHBox.hxx, vcl/source/control/PriorityMergedHBox.cxx.

